    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Today’s young people are gradually living without personal intention, simply following what society deems as common sense or the “normal” way of life. But I believe there’s no such thing as truly “ordinary” or “normal” in this world. What society sees as the “right” path often leads people to chase it blindly — and that kind of life can be exhausting. “It’s okay. You can try again tomorrow.” This work was created to share that very message with you</marc:subfield>
